classDiagram
    class Task {
        +str title
        +str start_time
        +int duration_minutes
        +str priority
        +str recurrence
        +date due_date
        +bool completed
        +Optional~str~ pet_name
        +str notes
        +int start_minutes
        +int end_minutes
        +mark_completed() Optional~Task~
    }
    class Pet {
        +str name
        +str species
        +Optional~int~ age
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +get_tasks(include_completed) list~Task~
    }
    class Owner {
        +str name
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +get_all_tasks(include_completed) list~Task~
        +find_pet(name) Pet
    }
    class Scheduler {
        +dict PRIORITY_ORDER$
        +Owner owner
        +get_schedule(for_date, pet_name, completed) list~Task~
        +find_conflicts(for_date) list~tuple~
        +complete_task(task) Optional~Task~
        +explain_schedule(tasks) str
    }
    note for Scheduler "find_conflicts returns (earlier Task, later Task) pairs"
    Owner "1" o-- "0..*" Pet : manages
    Pet "1" o-- "0..*" Task : has
    Scheduler --> Owner : reads tasks from
    Scheduler ..> Task : schedules and completes
    Scheduler ..> Pet : adds next occurrence to
    Task ..> Task : creates next occurrence
